  "name": "autobahn-artifact",
  "description": "A high-performance BFT consensus engine implemented in Rust, serving as a research prototype for the Sailfish protocol and its Autobahn optimization variant. It leverages a Directed Acyclic Graph (DAG) structure to decouple transaction dissemination from metadata ordering, achieving high throughput through parallel proposal slots and optimistic validation. The system integrates a robust networking layer, RocksDB-backed persistent storage, and cryptographic primitives for signature aggregation and quorum verification.",
